{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "561bf616f1c574e13317c38099ee06b97f6943ac6bcd5ed422fb6cf7bbd95b8a", "ja": "花より、だんごより……", "zh": "比起赏花，比起团子……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "e906c5c39726a2b5d1c4ce1dfaf08f480060d6e88ca4d8be5e8ef05e9bdbee2b", "ja": "イベントも終盤に差し掛かり、残すはライブ\nのみ。雪歩は、みんなお花見に夢中でこっち\nを見てくれないのではと心配するが、お花見\n以上に楽しいライブにすれば問題ないと励ま\nされ、気合いを入れなおすのだった。", "zh": "活动也接近尾声，只剩下演唱会了。雪步担心大家都沉浸在赏花中，根本不会看这边，但在被鼓励说只要举办比赏花更开心的演唱会就没问题后，她重新振作起来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1000_p", "source_sha256": "136310b5dc04599320a2dbdc5605014010320ac59500d745edd7342fb646d3f2", "ja": "（イベントも終盤に差し掛かってきた。\nあとは、最後のライブを残すだけ……）", "zh": "（活动渐渐接近尾声了。接下来只剩最后的演唱会……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1001_047sub", "source_sha256": "75799e68d67be5701c4d825209170b6c6b598b789e212551c091e527801561c5", "ja": "今日一日、すっげー楽しかった♪　いっぱい食べて、\nいっぱい遊んで……お花見、最高だな！", "zh": "今天一整天都超级开心♪ 吃了好多东西，\n也玩了个痛快……赏花真是太棒了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1002_004yuk", "source_sha256": "6679e07d2c68d0719f3e2d214634e1400e40a5ddd460246b11d1bce1ca3c8050", "ja": "私も……ファンの人たちやみんなが一緒で、\nすごく楽しかったよ。で、でも……。", "zh": "我也……和粉丝们以及大家一起，\n特别开心。可、可是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1003_p", "source_sha256": "4db22fb9472a6fe6c5538a40be6051eaa94a8a3cb87fcc3c7abd94047d5ff75f", "ja": "雪歩、何か心配事か？", "zh": "雪步，你有什么烦心事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1004_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f59215d42c4b27f34de06b14e931d18035c8a652fe7bae8edbbe26f57fc8e60f", "ja": "はい。もし、お花見で満足しちゃったら……\n私たちのステージ、ちゃんと見てもらえるかな？って。", "zh": "是的。要是赏花就已经满足了的话……\n不知道大家还会不会好好看我们的舞台……我是这么想的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "43b5575152a20994b8f14b1c8c0f6f0bc5d9c917abe2f37560f6c1658f235148", "ja": "お花見が楽しすぎて、逆に不安ってこと？\nうーん……わかるような、わかんないような……。", "zh": "赏花太开心了，反而让你感到不安吗？\n嗯……好像能理解，又好像不太能理解……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1006_004yuk", "source_sha256": "f2b7b35e2009467aa488c0ed4f99ef88bc16e21c19aa39abe762924b1f682c05", "ja": "わ、私たちが歌っても……みんな全然見てくれなくて、\n射的を続けてたらどうしよう～……ぐすっ。", "zh": "可、可是就算我们唱歌……大家也完全不看我们，要是一直玩射击游戏该怎么办啊～……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1007_043nor", "source_sha256": "8c4e6e11b52178b444f5775c92aeebb1627d74bda1cce0cc00ad6110e3fe244a", "ja": "雪歩はホント心配性だなぁ。\n確かに、お花見はスッゴク楽しかったよ。でもね……。", "zh": "雪步真是太爱操心了。确实，赏花特别开心。不过呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1008_043nor", "source_sha256": "3bba93fa10b3d6aad968aef2cf18b332a6f3ba3ff9bd0de4a4d5292bd892bf95", "ja": "アタシたちの力で、お花見より、もっともーっと\n楽しくて賑やかなステージにすればいいんだよ♪", "zh": "用我们的力量，把舞台变得比赏花更加更加开心热闹，不就好了吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1009_047sub", "source_sha256": "78351078abf5420c9d68e4d7d55ed7d1ab5106b208032d50685828be9a438c9a", "ja": "そうそう。いいこと言うじゃん、のり子！\nステージを盛り上げるなら、オレに任せとけ♪", "zh": "没错没错。说得好啊，乃莉子！\n要是想让舞台热闹起来，就交给我吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1010_p", "source_sha256": "aa0071e46c1386e657ae5ebc12bbb59f13b34cc04baea14cbcf0a1e85f2d173e", "ja": "そういうことだから、雪歩……不安な気持ちを\n吹き飛ばすくらい、思いきりステージを楽しもう！", "zh": "就是这样，雪步……让我们尽情享受舞台吧，把不安的心情全都抛到脑后！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1011_004yuk", "source_sha256": "466a1e89670298a4b40df9ebc4cca89a63341da5c53be1353057d59dfc9438fa", "ja": "{$P$}……わ、わかりました！\nステージを盛り上げられるよう、がんばりますぅ！", "zh": "{$P$}……我、我明白了！\n为了让舞台热闹起来，我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "663cef6f29b8f5294744e865a5f91bf53d071fb6191593a93188f3af974d15c1", "ja": "その調子だ！　みんなが楽しめば、ファンも一緒に\n楽しんでくれる。……それじゃみんな、行って来い！", "zh": "就是这个劲头！大家开心的话，粉丝也会跟着开心。……那么，各位，上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0275_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0275_story_05_1013_004yuk", "source_sha256": "c8437da922b05a66a006272ae646cc70f57e96453c9e5b620e3abbd8e90368f7", "ja": "はい！", "zh": "好的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
